This is a modified version. Changes made for the 26.3 port (the full list is in the git history
of the port/26.3 branch):
- Ported to Minecraft 26.3, Fabric Loader 0.19 / Loom 1.18 (unobfuscated Minecraft), Java 25.
- Portal rendering rewritten for Minecraft's new graphics layer (see docs/rendering-26.3.md):
  offscreen portal views, per-dimension LevelRenderer/LevelExtractor, shader-based front clipping.
- Removed the stencil, framebuffer and GL-query based renderers and related helpers.
- Updated mixins, access widener, data (dimension types) and networking to 26.3 APIs.
- Disabled fetching update/compatibility info from the original author's server.
- Renamed to "Immersive Portals (Unofficial 26.3 Port)"; contact links point to this port.
